  "readme": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/logo.png\" width=\"200\" alt=\"ReVanced Extended Logo by @ev3rlin\">\n\n  # ReVanced Extended Magisk Module (mod by [@ev3rlin](https://github.com/ev3rlin))\n\n  [![Telegram](https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-2CA5E0?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white)](https://t.me/ev3rlin_rvx)\n\n  [![License](https://img.shields.io/github/license/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended)](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended?tab=GPL-3.0-1-ov-file#readme)\n  [![CI](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg?event=schedule)](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n\n  [![Release date](https://img.shields.io/github/release-date/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended)](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended/releases)\n  [![Release version](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended?display_name=release)](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended/releases/latest)\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## 📌 Patches List\n\n| Patch / Application | YouTube RVX | YouTube Music RVX |\n|----------------------|-------------|-------------------|\n| Included patches | • Visual preferences icons for YouTube<br>• Return YouTube Username | • Visual preferences icons for YouTube Music<br>• Return YouTube Username<br>• Disable music video in album |\n| Excluded patches | • Custom header for YouTube | • Custom header for YouTube Music |\n| App name | YouTube RVX | YT Music RVX |\n| App icon | [Vanced Black](https://github.com/anddea/revanced-patches/wiki/Icons) | [Vanced Black](https://github.com/anddea/revanced-patches/wiki/Icons) |\n| Light Theme Background Color | #FFF9F9F9 | - |\n\n\n## 🚀 Features\n\n  * Updated automatically with the latest supported versions of apps and [anddea patches (stable version)](https://github.com/anddea/revanced-patches)\n  * Optimize APKs and modules for size\n  * Fully open-source and free to use\n  * Modules:\n    - recompile invalidated odex for faster usage\n    - receive updates from Magisk app\n    - do not break safetynet or trigger root detections\n    - handle installation of the correct version of the stock app and all that\n    - support Magisk and KernelSU\n\n## 📝 Notes\n\n  * <ins>Root</ins> versions: use [zygisk-detach](https://github.com/j-hc/zygisk-detach) to detach YouTube and YT Music from Play Store if you are using magisk modules\n  * <ins>Non-root</ins> versions: require [MicroG-RE](https://github.com/MorpheApp/MicroG-RE) to work\n\n## 🙏 Credits\n\n  [j-hc](https://github.com/j-hc) for [zygisk-detach](https://github.com/j-hc/zygisk-detach) and the [ReVanced apps builder](https://github.com/j-hc/revanced-magisk-module) and some more technical stuff\n\n  [Morphe](https://github.com/MorpheApp) for [MicroG-RE](https://github.com/MorpheApp/MicroG-RE)\n\n  [anddea](https://github.com/anddea) for [revanced-extended patches](https://github.com/anddea/revanced-patches)\n",
  "readmeHTML": "<p><div align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"assets/logo.png\" width=\"200\" alt=\"ReVanced Extended Logo by @ev3rlin\"></p>\n\n<p>  # ReVanced Extended Magisk Module (mod by <a href=\"https://github.com/ev3rlin\">@ev3rlin</a>)</p>\n\n<p>  <a href=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-2CA5E0?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white\">![Telegram</a>](https://t.me/ev3rlin_rvx)</p>\n\n<p>  <a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended\">![License</a>](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended?tab=GPL-3.0-1-ov-file#readme)</p>\n<p>  <a href=\"https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg?event=schedule\">![CI</a>](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended/actions/workflows/ci.yml)</p>\n\n<p>  <a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release-date/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended\">![Release date</a>](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended/releases)</p>\n<p>  <a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended?display_name=release\">![Release version</a>](https://github.com/ev3rlin/ReVanced-Extended/releases/latest)</p>\n<p></div></p>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<h2>📌 Patches List</h2>\n\n<p>| Patch / Application | YouTube RVX | YouTube Music RVX |</p>\n<p>|----------------------|-------------|-------------------|</p>\n<p>| Included patches | • Visual preferences icons for YouTube<br>• Return YouTube Username | • Visual preferences icons for YouTube Music<br>• Return YouTube Username<br>• Disable music video in album |</p>\n<p>| Excluded patches | • Custom header for YouTube | • Custom header for YouTube Music |</p>\n<p>| App name | YouTube RVX | YT Music RVX |</p>\n<p>| App icon | <a href=\"https://github.com/anddea/revanced-patches/wiki/Icons\">Vanced Black</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/anddea/revanced-patches/wiki/Icons\">Vanced Black</a> |</p>\n<p>| Light Theme Background Color | #FFF9F9F9 | - |</p>\n\n\n<h2>🚀 Features</h2>\n\n<p>  * Updated automatically with the latest supported versions of apps and <a href=\"https://github.com/anddea/revanced-patches\">anddea patches (stable version)</a></p>\n<p>  * Optimize APKs and modules for size</p>\n<p>  * Fully open-source and free to use</p>\n<p>  * Modules:</p>\n<p>    - recompile invalidated odex for faster usage</p>\n<p>    - receive updates from Magisk app</p>\n<p>    - do not break safetynet or trigger root detections</p>\n<p>    - handle installation of the correct version of the stock app and all that</p>\n<p>    - support Magisk and KernelSU</p>\n\n<h2>📝 Notes</h2>\n\n<p>  * <ins>Root</ins> versions: use <a href=\"https://github.com/j-hc/zygisk-detach\">zygisk-detach</a> to detach YouTube and YT Music from Play Store if you are using magisk modules</p>\n<p>  * <ins>Non-root</ins> versions: require <a href=\"https://github.com/MorpheApp/MicroG-RE\">MicroG-RE</a> to work</p>\n\n<h2>🙏 Credits</h2>\n\n<p>  <a href=\"https://github.com/j-hc\">j-hc</a> for <a href=\"https://github.com/j-hc/zygisk-detach\">zygisk-detach</a> and the <a href=\"https://github.com/j-hc/revanced-magisk-module\">ReVanced apps builder</a> and some more technical stuff</p>\n\n<p>  <a href=\"https://github.com/MorpheApp\">Morphe</a> for <a href=\"https://github.com/MorpheApp/MicroG-RE\">MicroG-RE</a></p>\n\n<p>  <a href=\"https://github.com/anddea\">anddea</a> for <a href=\"https://github.com/anddea/revanced-patches\">revanced-extended patches</a></p>",
